prompt:
Draft a dispute letter for the following invoice.

INVOICE
  id:            INV-DEM-88431
  billing party: MAERSK
  container:     MSKU7481920
  total billed:  $3150

GROUNDS (each already verified to carry a citation)
1. Effective last free day understated
   amount: $620
   argument: Container discharged 3 Mar but not grounded/appointable until 5 Mar; two free days consumed by terminal handling.
   citations: terminal::availability::MSKU7481920
2. Charges billed during no-appointment window
   amount: $1395
   argument: On 13-15 Mar the appointment system offered no slot despite logged attempts; these top-tier days are a carrier capacity failure.
   citations: terminal::appointments::MSKU7481920

EVIDENCE TIMELINE
  2026-03-03T08:00  discharged                Container discharged from vessel  [terminal::availability::MSKU7481920]
  2026-03-05T14:00  container_available       Container grounded and appointable  [terminal::availability::MSKU7481920]

Contest only the amounts itemised in the grounds above. The amount_contested_usd field must equal their sum exactly. Populate citations with every source_document_id you relied on.

Reply with ONE JSON object and nothing else - no prose, no markdown fences. Omit optional fields you cannot fill rather than inventing them, and do not add fields that are not listed. It must validate against this JSON schema:
{
  "additionalProperties": false,
  "properties": {
    "invoice_id": {
      "title": "Invoice Id",
      "type": "string"
    },
    "container_id": {
      "title": "Container Id",
      "type": "string"
    },
    "subject": {
      "title": "Subject",
      "type": "string"
    },
    "body": {
      "title": "Body",
      "type": "string"
    },
    "amount_contested_usd": {
      "anyOf": [
        {
          "minimum": 0.0,
          "type": "number"
        },
        {
          "pattern": "^(?!^[-+.]*$)[+-]?0*\\d*\\.?\\d*$",
          "type": "string"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Amount Contested Usd"
    },
    "citations": {
      "items": {
        "type": "string"
      },
      "title": "Citations",
      "type": "array"
    },
    "drafted_at": {
      "format": "date-time",
      "title": "Drafted At",
      "type": "string"
    }
  },
  "required": [
    "invoice_id",
    "container_id",
    "subject",
    "body",
    "amount_contested_usd",
    "drafted_at"
  ],
  "title": "DisputeLetter",
  "type": "object"
}
